      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{5x}{x^2+3x+2}+\\frac{3x}{x^2+4x+3}-\\frac{8x}{x^2+5x+6}&=\\frac{5x}{(x+1)(x+2)}+\\frac{3x}{(x+1)(x+3)}-\\frac{8x}{(x+2)(x+3)}\\\\\\frac{5x}{x^2+3x+2}+\\frac{3x}{x^2+4x+3}-\\frac{8x}{x^2+5x+6}&=\\frac{5x(x+3)+3x(x+2)-8x(x+1)}{(x+1)(x+2)(x+3)}\\\\\\frac{5x}{x^2+3x+2}+\\frac{3x}{x^2+4x+3}-\\frac{8x}{x^2+5x+6}&=\\frac{5x^2+15x+3x^2+6x-8x^2-8x}{(x+1)(x+2)(x+3)}\\\\\\frac{5x}{x^2+3x+2}+\\frac{3x}{x^2+4x+3}-\\frac{8x}{x^2+5x+6}&=\\frac{13x}{(x+1)(x+2)(x+3)}\\end{align*}$$",
